cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.'
title: 'citemap-core: citation network analysis for the CiteMap research tool'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Takayev
    given-names: Askhat
    affiliation: Astana IT University
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-24
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/verozroke/citemap-core'
abstract: >-
  A Python package that builds directed citation graphs from bibliographic
  records, ranks papers by PageRank influence, filters networks by year and
  citation count, and exports graphs for interactive visualisation. Includes
  adapters for offline JSON datasets and the OpenAlex API.
keywords:
  - bibliometrics
  - citation network
  - pagerank
  - openalex
  - scientometrics
